---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Prose from '../components/Prose.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Why Cuerpo Coffee exists, who writes it, and what it's for: helping beginners make good coffee at home without the gear obsession."
>
  <article class="container about">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <Prose>
      <p>
        Cuerpo Coffee exists because most coffee writing is aimed at people who already
        know what a refractometer is. This is for everyone else: the people who want a
        genuinely good cup at home, without buying $2,000 of equipment or memorizing a
        dozen brewing rituals first.
      </p>
      <p>
        <!-- TODO (owner): replace with the real bio and a real photograph before launch. -->
        I got into coffee the way most people do: badly, with a bad burr grinder and worse
        water. Every article here comes from a mistake I made first, so you don't have to
        make it too.
      </p>
      <p>
        This publication teaches fundamentals over gear, and troubleshooting over trends.
        If an article doesn't make your next cup better, it hasn't done its job.
      </p>
    </Prose>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-block: var(--space-8);
    max-width: var(--measure);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .about h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }
</style>
